, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 10,0:02:06.81,0:02:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Beni yiyecek!!Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.77,0:02:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Al bakalım!Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.68,0:02:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dikkat et, Iceburg!Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.25,0:02:37.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun sen, Franky?!Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.97,0:02:44.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal!Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.59,0:02:44.18,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.18,0:02:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan!Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.43,0:02:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada ne yapıyorsun?! Hiç yardımcı olmuyorsun!Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.94,0:02:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek yaptığın tehlikeli saçmalıklar yaratmak!Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.14,0:02:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni ilgilendirmez, Aptalburg!Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.44,0:02:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu benim müthiş savaş gemim, Battle Franky!Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.65,0:03:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olduğu umrumda değil!  Biri yaralanmadan önce kurtul ondan!Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.97,0:03:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne istersem yaparım!Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.67,0:03:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası Hurda Adası!Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.28,0:03:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gör bakalım.Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.15,0:03:08.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir dahaki sefere Deniz Kralı'nı devirebilecek bir savaş gemisi yapacağım!Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.33,0:03:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, tabii!Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.60,0:03:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece kendini yedirteceksin.Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapabilirim!Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.58,0:03:12.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, yapamazsın!Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.71,0:03:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, yapabilirim!Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.33,0:03:14.82,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, yapamazsın!Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.67,0:03:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Eğer erkeksen, DON'la yap! ♪Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.84,0:03:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte bu kadar!Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.27,0:03:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,DON'la yapılmış güzel, sağlam bir gemi!Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.74,0:03:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle değil mi, Yokozuna?Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.17,0:03:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak, vırak!Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.55,0:03:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yarın bitiririz.Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelin hadi, eve gidelim.Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.65,0:03:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak, vırak!Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, acıktım.Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.64,0:03:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak, vırak!Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.43,0:03:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acaba yemekte ne var?Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak, vırak!Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.29,0:04:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin, Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.38,0:04:15.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki son Battle Franky modelin nedir, Franky?Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.06,0:04:16.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sekiz Numara...Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.11,0:04:17.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ve bu kez çok yakındım!Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.69,0:04:18.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalancı!Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.75,0:04:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san çok hoşgörülü olduğu için hep yanına kâr kalıyor!Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece silah yapıyorsun!Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa çeneni, Aptalburg!Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.32,0:04:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da neydi, Aptalanky?!Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.58,0:04:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal...Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, tamam!Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İkiniz de kesin.Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– O başlattı, Kokoro-san! – O başlattı, Kokoro-san!Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.04,0:04:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah.Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.02,0:04:43.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok fazla gülüyorsun, Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.07,0:04:45.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana ne oldu bilmem.Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.80,0:04:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, evet. Sahi.Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.00,0:04:51.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir kereste nakliyesinin daha korsanlarca yolunun kesildiğini duydum.Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.88,0:04:55.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı'nın infazından sonra, korsanların sayısı önemli ölçüde arttı.Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.76,0:04:59.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu şehrin başı gerçekten dertte.  Korsan Çağı tarafından yutulmuş durumda.Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanların cesareti kırıldı.Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.02,0:05:09.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna yüzünden, başka adalardan kereste ve demir almak zorundayız...Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.12,0:05:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ama ticaret, kötü hava ve korsanlar yüzünden büyük ölçüde engellendi.Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.91,0:05:17.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İş azlığı çeken tersane işçileri, müşteriler konusunda birbirleriyle kavga etmeye başladı.Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.76,0:05:19.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanlar işlerini kaybediyor.Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.07,0:05:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu durumda Water Seven, öylece sel baskınının gelmesini bekleyen terkedilmiş bir ada olacak.Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.46,0:05:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir zamanlar gemi yapımı konusunda önde gelen aynı Water Seven.Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.38,0:05:33.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.49,0:05:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san müthiş bir korsan gemisi yaptı!Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.56,0:05:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, bana korsan gemisi planlarını göster!Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.02,0:05:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye gülüyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.49,0:05:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky,...Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.42,0:05:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,..."korsan gemisi planları" diye bir şey yoktur.Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.07,0:05:53.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizciler kurukafalı bir bayrak çekerse korsan gemisi olur.Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.37,0:05:55.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Martılı bayrak çekerlerse Denizci gemisi olur.Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.46,0:05:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi marangozunun konuyla ilgisi yoktur.Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.33,0:06:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ancak bir erkek, gemileriyle duyduğu gururu DON'la göstermelidir!Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.75,0:06:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san, uyumayacak mısın?Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.49,0:06:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne çiziyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.88,0:06:13.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey,Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.86,0:06:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bu, adanın umudu.Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.14,0:06:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umut mu?Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.42,0:06:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bununla Water Seven'ın kurtulacağını umuyorum.Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.20,0:06:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi, git uyu bakalım.Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.41,0:06:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam.Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.85,0:06:49.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümet'in adli gemisi geldi!Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.05,0:06:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adli gemi mi? O da ne?Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzen bir adliye sarayı.Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.89,0:06:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acaba kimi yargılamaya geldiler.Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.56,0:07:00.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun biraz!Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.55,0:07:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san ne yaptı?! Bir hata olmalı!Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.93,0:07:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bırakın onu!Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.52,0:07:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şey olmaz. Endişelenmeyin.Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.20,0:07:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.57,0:07:15.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.87,0:07:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kısa süre önce infaz edilen Korsanlar Kralı...Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.04,0:07:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Gold Roger'ın gemisi Oro Jackson'u yapmışsın.Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.67,0:07:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi marangozu Tom, küresel korsanlığın suç ortağıydı.Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.14,0:07:30.54,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele!Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.45,0:07:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi marangozu Tom!  Enies Lobby'ye...Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.39,0:07:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...gönderileceksin!Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.56,0:07:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni ölüme mahkum ediyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.60,0:07:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.02,0:07:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haberler kötü!Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.60,0:07:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom... Tom ölüme mahkum edildi!Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.64,0:07:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı'nın gemisini yaptığı için.Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.53,0:07:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek nihayet oldu.Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O adam bela makinesi.Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapacak bir şey yok.Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.41,0:07:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim olursa olsun,  normalde birine gemi satmak suç değildir.Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.09,0:08:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ancak Korsanlar Kralı özel bir durum.Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.37,0:08:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona biraz bile yardım eden kimse tehlikeli olarak kabul edilir.Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.85,0:08:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonuç olarak, ölmen gerekiyor!Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.56,0:08:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Götürün onu.Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.36,0:08:11.84,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.84,0:08:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim!Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.22,0:08:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kıpırda!Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.12,0:08:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu? Kıpırda hadi.Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.61,0:08:19.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, ne yapıyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.01,0:08:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu sıralar...Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.46,0:08:20.77,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.18,0:08:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...denizde raylar üzerinde DON'la ilerleyebilen...Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.53,0:08:26.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...buhar gücüyle çalışan bir kürekli gemi tasarlıyorum.Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.65,0:08:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pislik herif, ne gevezelik ediyorsun?!Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.15,0:08:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni..Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.57,0:08:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gittikçe batan bu adanın üzücü ticaret sorunu,...Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.67,0:08:44.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...şehir halkının kaygısından kaynaklanan tedirgin atmosfer.Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.46,0:08:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz treni tüm bu sorunları çözecek ve hiç şüphesiz Water Seven'ın kurtarıcısı olacak!Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.38,0:08:55.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Afedersiniz! Onu hemen götüreceğiz!Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.82,0:08:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, durun biraz.Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.93,0:09:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz treni mi dedin?Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.97,0:09:06.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adadan adaya deniz rayları üstünden giden, duman çıkaran bir gemi.Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.77,0:09:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolcuları, eşyaları, hatta gemileri bile taşıyabilir ve havadan etkilenmez.Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.53,0:09:15.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İsteyen herkes okyanusu özgürce geçebilir.Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.17,0:09:16.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu nasıl bir fantazi?Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.70,0:09:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raylar, Aqua Laguna tarafından yok edilirdi!Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.82,0:09:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, evet!Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.02,0:09:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üstelik okyanus Deniz Kralları'yla kaynıyor!Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.48,0:09:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz raylarının bir yerde çakılı olmasına gerek yok.Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.23,0:09:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzeyin hemen altından uzanacaklar ve böylece dalgalardan etklenmeyecekler.Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.09,0:09:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz treni sadece, bir iple çekiliyormuşçasına onları izleyecek.Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.26,0:09:40.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca balıkların sevmediği...Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.62,0:09:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...uyumsuz bir ses yayan denetim kollu bir mekanizma da düşünüyorum.Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.98,0:09:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böylece, Deniz Kralları bile raylardan uzak duracak.Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.23,0:09:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir şey gerçekten mümkün olabilir mi?Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.54,0:09:56.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saint Poplar, Puchi ve San Faldo. Bu adalara bağlantılar kurabilirsek,...Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.86,0:10:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...onlarla olan ticaretimiz ve ilişkilerimiz gelişecek.Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.70,0:10:01.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muhteşem!Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.74,0:10:07.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Planları neredeyse tamamlandı ama herhangi bir gemi marangozunun yapabileceği bir şey değil.Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.25,0:10:10.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby'ye de bir bağlantı olabilir mi?Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.17,0:10:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette.Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.11,0:10:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu teknoloji uygulamaya konduğunda, bütün okyanusa yayılacak.Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.21,0:10:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünya çapında adalar arasındaki dinamik DON'la değişecek!Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.68,0:10:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz treni, Water Seven'ın umudu!Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.35,0:10:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar sürecek?Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.81,0:10:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On yıl.Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.27,0:10:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse yapmanı emrediyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.98,0:10:33.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi Yapım Mühendisi Tom,...Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.06,0:10:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...deniz trenini geliştirmen için,  cezanı on yıl erteliyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Müthiş!Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.56,0:10:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elinden geleni yap, Tom!Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.45,0:10:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven'ı kurtar!Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.37,0:10:51.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,DON'la hayatımı kurtardım!Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.54,0:10:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gülünecek bir şey değil, Tom-san.Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.00,0:10:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ensemden aşağı soğuk terler döküldü! Zamanının dolduğunu sandım!Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.76,0:11:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşler yolunda giderse,  Roger davasını bırakacak gibiler.Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.18,0:11:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Tom-san inanılmazsın!Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.56,0:11:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aklında böyle bir şey varmış! Herkes çok şaşırdı.Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.27,0:11:10.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz treni hiç şüphesiz-Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.35,0:11:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yemek için teşekkürler! Gel, Yokozuna. Sana kulaç atmayı göstereceğim.Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.27,0:11:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak!Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.44,0:11:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, neyin var, Franky?!  Somurtmayı kes!Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.99,0:11:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa çeneni!Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.40,0:11:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu olanlara sinirlendim!Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.24,0:11:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger'ın Grand Line boyunca yol alan türde bir gemisi var!Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.48,0:11:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye bu kadar müthiş bir gemi yaptığı için Tom-san'ı infaz etmek zorundalar?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.91,0:11:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanlar da özel bir şey değilmiş gibi davranıyordu.Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.83,0:11:34.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O aptallar sal bile yapamaz!Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.92,0:11:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu hep biliyordum!Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.56,0:11:38.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden şirketimiz bir köprünün altında.Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.25,0:11:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'ın gemisini yaptığı için insanlar tarafından uzaklaştırıldı!Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.26,0:11:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünyanın en iyi gemi marangozuna nasıl böyle davranabilirler?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.14,0:11:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar komik olan ne, seni boynuzlu tanuki?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.54,0:11:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yaptığını sanıyorsun, Aptalanky?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur!Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun ölmesine izin vermeyeceğim!Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.61,0:12:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, hayır. Öyle değil!Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.82,0:12:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suya sağlam vur ve sonra geri doğru ittir!Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.45,0:12:06.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak! Vırak!Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.81,0:12:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, tamamen yanlış!Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu şekilde hareket etmelisin!Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.70,0:12:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun nesi var?!Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.80,0:12:13.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O aptalı kovsak iyi olur!Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.79,0:12:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, öyle deme. Bizimle birlikte gemiler yapıyor ve arkadaşımız.Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.92,0:12:22.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi yapım yetenekleri çoktan adanın zanaatkârlarıyla aynı seviyede.Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.30,0:12:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tehlikeli şeyler yaptığını kabul ediyorum.Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.55,0:12:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bazı şeyler hiç değişmiyor.Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.89,0:12:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O çocuk DON'la Hurda Adası'nda iki yıl önce ortaya çıktı.Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.52,0:12:40.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşe yaramaz malzemelerden top yapabilmesinden etkilenmiştim.Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.24,0:12:45.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Amca, lütfen beni işe al! Babam tarafından terkedildim!Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.70,0:12:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorduğumdaysa, babasının baş belası olduğu için gemilerinden attığını söyledi.Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.97,0:12:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kulağa işe yaramaz bir korsanmış gibi geliyor.Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.20,0:12:57.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne pot kırdım ama!Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.19,0:12:57.08,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san...Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.08,0:12:59.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cesur, küçük bir çocuk.Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.61,0:13:02.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kötü biri değil.Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.55,0:13:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç şüphesiz ikiniz bir gün, dünyanın en ünlü gemi yapımcıları olacaksınız.Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.22,0:13:09.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaşmaya çalışın!Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky'yle anlaşmak imkansız.Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.86,0:13:12.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biyolojik olarak imkansız.Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.94,0:13:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki, planlar biter bitmez deniz trenini yapalım!Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.04,0:13:18.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam.Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.95,0:13:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçi yardım etmeyeceği kesin.Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.07,0:13:25.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne isterse yapabilir.Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.69,0:15:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İntihar mı?Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.84,0:15:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,4. Tersane'nin Yöneticisi.Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.97,0:15:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kaza yüzündendi.Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.54,0:15:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Malzemeleri tükenmişti, bu yüzden kereste almak için yola çıktılar.Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.42,0:15:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizde 50 adam kaybettiler.Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görünüşe göre tersaneyi kapatıyorlar.Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.43,0:15:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanlar çok kırılgan.Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.46,0:15:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten bu adanın işi bitti mi?Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.31,0:15:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.86,0:15:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurda Adası'nda neler olduğunu duydunuz mu?!Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.55,0:15:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.69,0:15:32.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ciddi misin?!Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.99,0:15:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom'un İşçileri, deniz trenini tamamladı mı?!Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.37,0:15:39.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oooh, bu şey gerçekten çalışabilir mi?Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.91,0:15:42.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tehlikeli olabilir.  Bir suçlu tarafından yapıldı.Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben bineceğim!Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.15,0:15:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım... ben de.Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.29,0:15:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom, nasıl çalıştığını açıklamayacak mısın?Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.96,0:15:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte gidiyoruz! Herkes binsin!Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.26,0:15:57.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hareket ediyor!Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.55,0:16:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çark kanatları rayları tutuyor!Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hareket ediyor!Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnanılmaz! Çalışıyor!Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.21,0:16:18.42,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Bu 20 yıl önce oldu.Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.42,0:16:25.04,Narrator,,0,0,0,,O gün ilk kez, çökmekte olan şehrin endişeli halkını taşıyan...Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.01,0:16:34.59,Narrator,,0,0,0,,...deniz treni Üfleyen Tom, okyanusu geçti!Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.27,0:16:44.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum.Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.98,0:16:52.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek bu pis depo, bir zamanlar gemi yapım şirketi Tom'un İşçileri'nin ana ofisiydi.Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.84,0:16:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi yapım şirketi?Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.04,0:16:59.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom, Iceburg ve Cutty Flam.Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.10,0:17:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası üçünüzün gemiler üzerinde özenle çalıştığınız yer.Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.46,0:17:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gizli üssünüz olduğunu söylemek epey çocukça.Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.67,0:17:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa çeneni!Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.55,0:17:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Defol buradan!Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.63,0:17:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aradığımız şeyi alır almaz gideceğiz. Gemi marangozu Cutty Flam.Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada plan falan yok!Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.77,0:17:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle diyeceğini düşünmüştüm.Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.52,0:17:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.19,0:17:29.23,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa!Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.30,0:17:34.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah...Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.72,0:17:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-N-Ne yapacağım?Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.75,0:17:46.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lanet olası...Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.32,0:17:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu noktada bana cevap vermek zorunda değilsin.Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.84,0:17:52.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir kozumuz var.Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.55,0:17:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sekiz yıl öncesine uzanıyor.Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.25,0:17:58.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir suç teşebbüsünde bulunmuşsun.Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.76,0:18:00.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynı Tom gibi.Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa çeneni!Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.77,0:18:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san suçlu değildi!Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.43,0:18:07.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi bir serserinin anlayabileceği bir şey değil!Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.06,0:18:18.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.69,0:18:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzak durun!Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.45,0:18:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sessiz ol.Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.99,0:18:29.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi bir suçlu seçtiği yolu anlamalı.Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.66,0:18:31.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky,...Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.54,0:18:34.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,...şimdi ne olursa olsun karışma.Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.74,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olursa olsun!Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.74,0:18:39.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz şerefsizler,...Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.27,0:18:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Tom-san hakkında...Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.05,0:18:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ve bu Water Seven şehri hakkında ne biliyorsunuz ki?!Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.55,0:19:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üç gün için adli geminin geleceğini duydum.Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.57,0:19:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nihayet Tom'un duruşmasının vakti geldi mi?Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.08,0:19:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olacak acaba?Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.87,0:19:06.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eminim bir şey olmazDialogue: 10,0:19:06.58,0:19:07.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,EvetDialogue: 10,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonuçta sözünü tuttu.Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.60,0:19:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.17,0:19:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu keresteyi iskeleye götürün.Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.79,0:19:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saint Poplar'la görüşmeler nasıl gitti?Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.55,0:19:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pek iyi değil.Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.05,0:19:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizden faydalanmaya çalışıyorlar.Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.44,0:19:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,San Faldo'nun demirinde de durum aynı!Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.31,0:19:30.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O fiyatlar varken,  tersanenin başı dertte demektir!Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.27,0:19:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman bu konuda bir şey yapalım!Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.66,0:19:35.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! Doğru!Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.12,0:19:44.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes okyanusu geçebilmekten ötürü mutlu.Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.41,0:19:47.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama diğer adalarla iş yapmak zor.Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.18,0:19:50.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acaba bu, şehri gerçekten değiştirecek mi?Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.79,0:19:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanlar enerji dolu.Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.37,0:19:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonuçları hemen görmezsin, Iceburg.Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.55,0:20:03.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elinden geleni yapan bir kimse, onurunu DON'la göstermeli!Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.91,0:20:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.49,0:20:16.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi günler!Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.20,0:20:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi yapım mühendisi Tom bey sen misin?Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.81,0:20:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni arıyordum.Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.11,0:20:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.32,0:20:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Afedersin ama seninle birkaç kelime-Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.55,0:20:26.20,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey...Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapayın çenenizi!Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.14,0:20:28.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.75,0:20:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seninle birkaç kelime etmek is-Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.75,0:20:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Ben...Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.43,0:20:41.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Cipher Pol 5'ten...Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.66,0:20:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Spandam!Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.76,0:20:44.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam-san!Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.51,0:20:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, afedersin!Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.72,0:20:53.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimdi bilmem ama ne atıştı!Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.19,0:20:56.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve süper...Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.54,0:21:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Battle Franky 35 döndü!Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.00,0:21:01.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir Deniz Kralı'nı yendim!Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.40,0:21:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bakın!Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.18,0:21:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu canavar yüzlerce metre uzunluğunda olmalı!Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.99,0:21:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O aptal yine iş başında.Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.57,0:21:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, kes şunu, Aptalburg!Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaç kez söylemek zorundayım?!Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.06,0:21:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birbiri ardına savaş gemisi yapıyorsun!Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.63,0:21:24.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeter artık!Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.09,0:21:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapmayı kesmezsen,  onları burada kendim parçalayacağım!Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa çeneni!Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.01,0:21:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar benim için önemli!Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.98,0:21:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parçalamana izin vermeyeceğim!Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.55,0:21:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinle, Franky.Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.48,0:21:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir Deniz Kralı'nı devirdin, değil mi?Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.08,0:21:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu, o gemiyi tehlikeli bir silah yapar!Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.11,0:21:44.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl bu şeyi etrafta tutabilecek soğukkanlılığa sahip olabilirsin?!Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.19,0:21:47.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanlara saldıracak değilim ya!Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.66,0:21:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niyetin bu olmayabilir.Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.73,0:21:52.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama bu silahların sorumluluğunu üstlenmelisin, Aptalanky!Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.88,0:21:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bekle...Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.62,0:22:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san! Lütfen bir şey söyle!Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.46,0:22:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptalanky şirketimizi utandırmak için burada!Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.05,0:22:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine mi "Aptalanky"?Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.98,0:22:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Durun biraz lütfen!Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.43,0:22:11.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önce düzgün bir özür istiyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.45,0:22:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonra da beni dinlemenizi istiyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.97,0:22:16.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümet'tensin, değil mi?Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.45,0:22:18.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duruşma hakkında mı?Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.06,0:22:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Neden bahsediyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.90,0:22:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, öyle bir şeyden haberdar değilim.Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.03,0:22:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san nerede?Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.87,0:22:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalnız konuşmak istediklerini söyledi.Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.69,0:22:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümetten birkaç adamla depoda.Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.80,0:22:38.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spam... Neydi acaba?Dialogue: 10,0:22:38.20,0:22:40.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Spanda" falan gibi bir şey.Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.08,0:22:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O adamların adli gemiden olduğundan şüpheliyim.Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.48,0:22:46.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pek profesyonel gibi görünmüyorlar.Dialogue: 10,0:22:49.07,0:22:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır. Bende öyle planlar yok.Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.56,0:22:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni yalancı!Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.90,0:22:57.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben nazik olmaya çalışıyorum ve sen beni hiçe sayıyorsun!Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.71,0:23:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven'ın kalanında bir araştırma yaptım zaten!Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.90,0:23:04.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eminim senin eşyalarını aradığımda ortaya çıkacaktır!Dialogue: 10,0:23:06.88,0:23:09.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni soruşturmaya yetkin var mı?Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.55,0:23:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Var, Tom!Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.69,0:23:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin, Gold Roger'ın gemisini yapan aşağılık olduğunu öğrendim!Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.25,0:23:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suçlu olduğuna göre istediğimi yapabilirim.Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.56,0:23:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümet bunu zaten biliyor.Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.60,0:23:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.46,0:23:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu nasıl mümkün olabilir?!Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.47,0:23:32.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu doğruysa, nasıl serbestçe gemi marangozu olarak işine devam edebilirsin?Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.93,0:23:36.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen istihbarat ajanısın. Kendin çöz. Görüşürüz.Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.74,0:23:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, dur! Daha işimiz bitmedi!Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.89,0:23:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim kim olduğumu sanıyorsun?!Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.91,0:23:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, o mu?Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.86,0:23:52.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom, yargıca olan sözünü tuttuğu için.Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.16,0:23:56.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muhtemelen üç gün içinde duruşmasından beraat edecek.Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.01,0:23:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten mükemmel bir adam.Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.41,0:24:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şaka yapıyor olmalısın.Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.92,0:24:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'la alakalı ciddi bir suçtan beraat mı?Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.69,0:24:08.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek gerçekten var.Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.76,0:24:09.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.81,0:24:12.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğal olarak planlar için etrafta casusluk yapan korsanlar da var.Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.91,0:24:16.78,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümet dışından biri onları elde etseydi...Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.78,0:24:20.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,...güçleri bizim için bile emsalsiz olurdu.Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.06,0:24:24.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,"Büyük Korsanlar Çağı" nın ortaya çıkışından bu yana on yıl geçti.Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.18,0:24:28.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar süratle güçleniyor ve sayıca artıyor.Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.02,0:24:32.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,O antik silahın sadece yeniden ortaya çıkışını engellemek yetmez!Dialogue: 10,0:24:32.89,0:24:36.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Adalet ajanları olarak harekete geçmeliyiz!Dialogue: 10,0:24:36.37,0:24:41.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Antik silahı kendimiz elde etmeli ve Büyük Korsanlar Çağı'na son vermeliyiz!Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.33,0:24:47.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç şüphesiz zaman değişiyor.Dialogue: 10,0:24:47.54,0:24:52.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,O planları bul ve bize getir. O zaman ne yapacağımıza karar vereceğiz.Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.92,0:24:56.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu meseleyi tamamiyle sana bırakıyoruz, Spandam.Dialogue: 10,0:24:56.51,0:24:59.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz! Ben hallederim efendim.Dialogue: 10,0:25:00.06,0:25:02.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kadar can sıkıcı araştırmanın ardından,...Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.01,0:25:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bu şansın elimden kayıp gitmesine izin vermem mümkün değil!Dialogue: 10,0:25:10.74,0:25:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim!Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.03,0:25:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!Dialogue: 10,0:25:16.60,0:25:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suçlu değilse bittim ben!Dialogue: 10,0:25:20.99,0:25:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam-san!Dialogue: 10,0:25:28.33,0:25:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beraat etti, ha?Dialogue: 10,0:25:30.13,0:25:31.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu göreceğiz, sizi gidi kendini beğenmiş ahmaklar!Dialogue: 10,0:25:32.88,0:25:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, beş ajan daha çağırın!Dialogue: 10,0:25:36.08,0:25:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.25,0:25:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam-san!Dialogue: 10,0:25:47.07,0:25:48.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg. Franky.Dialogue: 10,0:25:48.78,0:25:49.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 10,0:25:49.45,0:25:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İkiniz de buraya gelin.Dialogue: 10,0:25:51.65,0:25:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size verecek önemli bir şeyim var.Dialogue: 10,0:25:58.17,0:26:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Niye böyle bir şey...Dialogue: 10,0:26:01.59,0:26:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İ-İnsanlar böyle bir şey yapabilir mi?Dialogue: 10,0:26:05.33,0:26:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu, gemi yapımının en korkunç canavarıdır.Dialogue: 10,0:26:09.29,0:26:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümet bu planların varlığını keşfetti ve...Dialogue: 10,0:26:11.96,0:26:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...harekete geçiyor.Dialogue: 10,0:26:13.53,0:26:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık bende olması güvenli değil.Dialogue: 10,0:26:15.80,0:26:17.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz korkutucu...Dialogue: 10,0:26:17.59,0:26:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ama anlıyorum. Senin için saklayacağız.Dialogue: 10,0:26:20.22,0:26:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu müthiş, Iceburg! Hey,...Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.97,0:26:25.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...gidip bu şeyi yapalım!Dialogue: 10,0:26:25.10,0:26:26.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal!Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.28,0:26:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acıdı!Dialogue: 10,0:26:28.39,0:26:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Konuşmadan önce biraz düşün!Dialogue: 10,0:26:30.34,0:26:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunlara ben göz kulak olacağım.Dialogue: 10,0:26:32.06,0:26:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir şey dünyaya getirilseydi,...Dialogue: 10,0:26:39.16,0:26:41.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, dünya mahvolurdu.Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.37,0:26:50.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama planlarla ne yapacağınız size kalmış.Dialogue: 10,0:26:50.26,0:26:51.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tehlikeye düşerseniz, onları yok edin.Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.96,0:26:53.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san...Dialogue: 10,0:26:53.46,0:26:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şey daha...Dialogue: 10,0:26:56.06,0:26:58.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni tedirgin eden bir şey...Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.59,0:01:59.39,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | kazaskerDialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:30.00,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | kazaskerDialogue: 0,0:26:59.73,0:27:03.34,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | kazaskerDialogue: 0,0:01:54.59,0:01:59.39,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Efsanevi Gemi MarangozuDialogue: 1,0:01:54.59,0:01:59.39,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Efsanevi Gemi MarangozuDialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:54.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven, 22 Yıl ÖnceDialogue: 1,0:01:51.80,0:01:54.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven, 22 Yıl ÖnceDialogue: 1,0:02:44.23,0:02:47.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg 16 YaşındaDialogue: 2,0:02:44.23,0:02:47.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg 16 YaşındaDialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:53.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam (Franky) 12 YaşındaDialogue: 1,0:02:50.19,0:02:53.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam (Franky) 12 YaşındaDialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:46.75,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom (Boynuzlu İnek Balığı, Balık Adam)  Tom'un Çalışanları Tersane Şirketi Genel MüdürüDialogue: 1,0:03:38.36,0:03:46.75,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom (Boynuzlu İnek Balığı, Balık Adam)  Tom'un Çalışanları Tersane Şirketi Genel MüdürüDialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna (Sumo Güreşçisi Kurbağa) Tom'un Evcil HayvanıDialogue: 1,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna (Sumo Güreşçisi Kurbağa) Tom'un Evcil HayvanıDialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:59.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven Köprü Altındaki Deponun ÖnüDialogue: 1,0:03:54.55,0:03:59.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven Köprü Altındaki Deponun ÖnüDialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:03.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurda Adası (Tom'un Çalışanlarının Tersanesi)Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.72,0:04:03.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurda Adası (Tom'un Çalışanlarının Tersanesi)Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro Tom'un Çalışanlarının Güzel SekreteriDialogue: 1,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro Tom'un Çalışanlarının Güzel SekreteriDialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:51.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven, 8 Yıl ÖnceDialogue: 1,0:18:47.98,0:18:51.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven, 8 Yıl ÖnceDialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:40.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam Cipher Pol 5'in BaşkanıDialogue: 1,0:20:34.34,0:20:40.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam Cipher Pol 5'in BaşkanıDialogue: 0,0:24:20.11,0:24:24.19,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Beş BüyüklerDialogue: 1,0:24:20.11,0:24:24.19,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Beş BüyüklerDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 2,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 2,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack ZenefDialogue: 1,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack ZenefDialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:01:02.42,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                    HaleeDialogue: 1,0:00:55.08,0:01:02.42,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                    HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 1,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 2,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,archıt3chtDialogue: 1,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,archıt3chtDialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 1,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 2,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,JT-421Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,JT-421Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TranslationDialogue: 1,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TranslationDialogue: 2,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TranslationDialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,archıt3cht GaijinDialogue: 1,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,archıt3cht GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:08.05,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Sorun yok! Yola çıkalım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.59,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Güneşi hep kalbimizde tutacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Birleşmiş ellerimiz bize güç veriyor! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.68,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Hayallerimizi yakalayacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:32.49,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Birleşmiş güçlerimizle dev bir dalgaya bineceğiz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:40.29,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,1,,♪ İşte işaret! Başarıya doğru acele edelim! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:47.13,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Bu bizim yola çıkma vaktimiz. Bir kez demir alınca...Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:55.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,...gökkuşağı renkli rüzgarla macera denizine doğru yola çıkacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:58.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Bu sıkıntıyla dolu bir yolculuk...Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:02.27,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,...ama orada önemli bir şey var. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:06.35,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Başın derde girerse,...Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,...yardım etmek için orada olacağım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:13.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Sorun yok! Yola çıkalım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:16.82,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Güneşi hep kalbimizde tutacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:20.33,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Bir fırtına gelirse omzunu benimkine yasla. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:24.20,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ İlerideki umut ışığına bakacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.67,0:01:27.92,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Hayallerimizin parçalarını toplarken,...Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:31.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,...bize yarının yolunu gösterecekler! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.72,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Bu yüzden aynı bayrak altında yolculuk ediyoruz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:38.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Hayallerimizi yakalayacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.45,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Biz birleşmişiz...